 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Kanchigai Kekkon: Itsuwari no Hanayome no Hazu ga, Naze ka Ryuuou Heika ni Dekiaisaretemasu!?"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "勘違い結婚 偽りの花嫁のはずが、なぜか竜王陛下に溺愛されてます!?"
   },
   {
    "en": "Misunderstood Marriage: I Was Supposed to Be a False Bride, but for Some Reason, His Majesty the Dragon King Is Madly in Love with Me!?"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Kanchigai Kekkon Itsuwari No Hanayome No Hazu Ga, Naze Ka Ryuo Heika Ni Dekiai Saretemasu!?"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Mireille, the princess of the small and struggling nation of Grilles, suddenly finds herself the subject of a marriage proposal from Cain, the king of the great nation of Drake. However, it quickly becomes clear that Cain’s true object of affection is her younger sister, and the proposal was made to the wrong person. Despite this revelation, Mireille is forced by her father to take her sister’s place and marry Cain as a stand-in bride. Prepared to bear the guilt of this deception, Mireille braces herself for a cold and loveless life. Yet, to her surprise, Cain cherishes her deeply as his bride. Why does he continue to treasure her so sincerely despite the truth?"
  },
